# What a data warehouse is

## A central store, built for analysis

- One repository collecting from **many source systems** — tuned for **reading**, not transactions

## Inmon's four traits

- **Subject-oriented** — organized around sales, customers, products (not the apps)
- **Integrated** — cleaned to one currency, date & definition, so figures reconcile
- **Time-variant** — keeps **history**; compare this quarter to last year
- **Non-volatile** — loaded then read; loads add data, they don't overwrite it
